config COUNTER_MCUX_LPC_RIT
	bool "NXP LPC Repetitive Interrupt Timer driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_NXP_LPC_RIT_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the Repetitive Interrupt Timer found on NXP LPC parts such as
	  the LPC546xx. The single compare register backs the counter top value,
	  so the device has no alarm channels.
